# Project placeholders and standard public package registry examples.
# Export values through your process environment after reviewing this template.
# The preflight CLI never reads this file or any .env file.
# Do not put credentials in these values.
# Public registries are examples only, not approved corporate feed settings.
# On managed devices, keep the approved Microsoft feed overrides in local .env;
# do not replace them with these examples. Preflight rejects public registries.
# CI, remote builds and sandbox images require approved authenticated feeds.
# Sources and remaining evidence requirements: docs/preflight.md
RES_PROJECT_ID=
AZURE_TENANT_ID=
AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=
AZURE_LOCATION=
RES_PYTHON_FEED_URL=https://pypi.org/simple/
RES_NUGET_FEED_URL=https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json
RES_NPM_FEED_URL=https://registry.npmjs.org/
